<title>LITHUANIA: TENNIS-YUGOSLAVIA LEAD 2-0 AGAINST LITHUANIA IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-YUGOSLAVIA LEAD 2-0 AGAINST LITHUANIA IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yugoslavia took a 2-0 lead in their tennis Davis Cup Euro/African zone group two, first round tie on Friday.</p>
<p>Singles:</p>
<p>Nenan Zimonjic (Yugoslavia) beat Rolandas Morashka 6-3, 6-1 6-3</p>
<p>Bojan Vujic (Yugoslavia) beat Elgenijus Cariovas (Lithuania) 7-6 (7-3), 7-6 (7-4), 6-2</p>
</text>
